 **Algorithm Steps:**
-1.  Generate coordinate grids $X, Y$ over the canvas dimensions $H_{canvas}, W_{canvas}$ using `torch.meshgrid`.
-2.  Initialize the output image $I$ to zeros and the transparency mask $T$ to ones.
